Dampftafel Wasser bei 10 bar: $vartheta_s = "179,89" thin "°C"$, $v' = "1,1272" thin "dm"^3/"kg"$, $v'' = "0,1943" thin "m"^3/"kg"$, $h' = "762,7"$, $h'' = "2777,2" thin "kJ/kg"$, $s' = "2,138"$, $s'' = "6,585" thin "kJ/(kg K)"$.

