][
*a) Mit Umgebung:* $C_A = 72$, $C_B = "27,6" thin "kJ/K"$; $Q_A = -64 thin 080 thin "kJ"$, $Q_B = -2484 thin "kJ"$, $Q_infinity = +66 thin 564 thin "kJ"$.
